+---
+title: "Result Claim Audit provenance gate"
+description: "Fail closed before external or quarantined content reaches Memory.add."
+---
+
+Mem0's OSS `Memory.add` accepts `metadata` and calls `_add_to_vector_store`
+after metadata normalization. The Result Claim Audit adapter wraps that exact
+boundary without changing Mem0's schema.
+
+```python
+from mem0 import Memory
+from mem0_result_claim_audit import ResultClaimAuditedMemory
+
+memory = ResultClaimAuditedMemory(Memory())
+memory.add(
+    "Fact extracted from an external document.",
+    user_id="user-123",
+    provenance={
+        "trust": "quarantined",
+        "origin": "retrieval",
+        "actor_kind": "rag_document",
+        "source_record_id": "document-42",
+        "source_ref": "https://example.com/document-42",
+    },
+)
+```
+
+The gate requires actor and record provenance, calls a bounded external audit,
+and stores the accepted receipt inside Mem0's normal metadata. Timeout, network
+failure, malformed output, missing provenance, and a non-result verdict all
+fail before the wrapped `Memory.add` is called.
+
+Runnable code and isolated tests:
+
+https://github.com/AInoAKARI/keymaster-mcp/tree/main/integrations/mem0-result-claim-audit
+
+Apply this documentation patch:
+
+```bash
+curl -L https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AInoAKARI/keymaster-mcp/main/patches/mem0ai-mem0-result-claim-audit.patch | git apply
+```
+
+The adapter test suite runs without a network call or Mem0 installation and
+covers accepted promotion, missing provenance, rejected verdict, audit outage,
+and foreground compatibility.
